{%- comment -%}
The head every subpage opens with: the title, then an optional lede and meta
line. Pass `lede_ink=true` for a lede set in the heading colour.

  title     defaults to page.title
  lede      optional; HTML allowed
  meta      optional small line under the lede; HTML allowed
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heading = include.title | default: page.title -%}
<div class="page-head measure">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ heading }}</h1>
    {%- if include.lede %}
    <p class="lede{% if include.lede_ink %} lede--ink{% endif %}">{{ include.lede }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if include.meta %}
    <p class="meta">{{ include.meta }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
</div>
